  "reps": "3–5 each way",
  "summary": "Lying on the back, straight legs lift up and over the head until they are level with the floor, then the spine rolls down bone by bone.",
  "steps": [
    "Lie on the back, arms pressing down by the sides, legs long at about 45°.",
    "Breathe in to lift the legs to vertical.",
    "Breathe out to peel the hips and spine up, legs reaching overhead until level with the floor.",
    "Breathe in to open the legs hip-width and flex the feet.",
    "Breathe out to roll down one bone at a time, then lower and close the legs."
  ],
